      "---",
      "## Hour 77: The Planet's Immune System",
      "I let the projected sword dissolve into blue ether.",
      "@@Gurtej|\"So Gilgamesh is dealt with for now. What's the final boss?\"",
      "Jaskaran stopped smiling. The manic energy left his eyes, replaced by a cold dread.",
      "@@Jaskaran|\"The Earth itself.\"",
      "Saber frowned, stepping forward. \"The Earth?\"",
      "@@Jaskaran|\"Listen to me carefully. Imagine the planet Earth is a human body. Right now, humanity is like a virus living on that body. The UN armies, the Clock Tower Magi... they are just a fever. They are human problems. But if we actually get close to winning the Grail... if we actually try to erase humanity...\"",
      "Jaskaran tapped the center of the map.",
